ind":"announcement","title":"How Long Will War Angels Be?","summary":"Here's is quick picture of how long War Angels will be. For the main story itself there will be 50+ events and most of them require your decisions. Throughout the story, you will follow Ahmed and the volunteer doctors trying to keep their hospital alive as the situation outside continues to deteriorate. Bombings spread, supplies become harder to find, patients keep arriving, and every decision becomes more difficult when you simply cannot save everyone.But the main story is only part of the game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T07:16:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1840944183781489","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Major Update 0.1.2.6","summary":"It's been two weeks since the War Angels demo was released. Over 100 players have filled out the feedback form. We hear you, Docs! Our team is working to improve the game, and we are excited to share the first update to the demo with you.War Angels — Patch Notes Demo Version 0.1.2.6 :New Story Events* Man With FlourNew Characters* Added new wounded-patient appearances, including two new looks for young female patients.New Gameplay* Added a brand-new cinematic intro that plays when starting a new","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T06:20:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1839676055885068","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"announcement","title":"What you will see inside the War Angels Demo","summary":"The Demo is finally here! After long long time of development, the demo is finally playable. Before you jump in, here is a quick look at what awaits you!Treat, Feed, and Keep Your Patients Together in a Warzone HospitalWill you help a desperate father and his severely wounded little girl?Build, Craft, TreatBuild a versatile hospital facility adapted to the warzone. Cultivate herbs to craft essential medicine. Out of space? Improvise and perform surgeries using whatever you have in a barely funct","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T12:26:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055885068","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1834602721188235","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3: Toxic Gas & Carrier","summary":"In this update, we’re introducing two new mechanics that push the game deeper into more immersion: Toxic Gas Outbreaks and the Carrier System for immobilized patients.Toxic Gas OutbreaksWhen bodies are left untreated in the hospital halls, decomposition can now spread deadly toxic outbreaks across nearby areas. These contaminated zones become hazardous for both civilians and hospital staff, forcing you to manage the growing crisis inside the hospital itself.Contaminated areas slowly become harde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T17:10:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188235","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1829528821316998","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"announcement","title":"War Angels – Public Playtest Post-Mortem (March 10 – April 10)","summary":"Hi everyone,Over the past month, we ran a public playtest for War Angels, and we want to share what we learned.This wasn’t just about testing systems, it was about understanding how players feel when they’re forced to make difficult decisions under pressure. This post is a reflection of that, what worked, what didn’t, and what we’re improving next.Playtest OverviewPeriod: March 10 – April 10252 players joined the playtestPlayers spent an average of 2 hours 4 minutes in the gameMedian playtime re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T06:10:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821316998","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1828894815559187","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"announcement","title":"Character Refinement","summary":"We’ve updated our characters to be more expressive and detailed, with improved animations for a more natural and immersive feel.Before vs AfterBelow you can see a direct comparison between the old and updated character designs.We believe these changes help bring the characters closer to the experience we want to deliver.As always, we’d love to hear your thoughts. Let us know what you think about the new look.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T04:00:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815559187","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1826362059932001","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"announcement","title":"War Angels Playtest Doors Are Open!","summary":"Reaching this playtest has taken a great deal of time, care, and hard work from our small team. War Angels is a deeply personal project for us, and this playtest marks an important milestone in its development.The War Angels Playtest is open for a limited time, and access is granted through request approval.Many elements are still in development, and some parts may change significantly. Please note that this playtest is an early build, so you may encounter bugs, unfinished features, or content t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-10T05:47:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059932001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3312350-1821922921812538","game_id":"steam-3312350","kind":"update","title":"Hello & Publishing Update","summary":"Hey everyone,Welcome to the very first devlog for War Angels. We’re really happy to finally start sharing updates with you here.We want to kick things off with some big news: we’re officially working with RockGame as our publisher, which means War Angels will be published by RockGame.As development went on, we realized that making War Angels the way we want to make it also means getting the right support. RockGame understands the kind of game we’re building, and they respect the direction we’re ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-15T11:23:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921812538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3312350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3312350":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3312350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z"},"3493280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:23Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3312350","app_id":3312350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"9321c91686bac84783c2088058538a5b82a95cae5c99285501180099a3d060a1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"모든 선택이 누군가의 죽음으로 이어지는 전쟁 병원을 운영하세요. War Angels는 실제 분쟁에서 영감을 받은 스토리 중심 병원 경영 게임입니다. 환자를 치료하고 자원을 관리하며 어려운 결정을 내려야 합니다. 옳은 답은 없고 결과만 있습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"RockGame S.A.","creator_clan_account_id":38885998}],"developers":[{"name":"Leolit Games","creator_clan_account_id":45834060}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"War Angels Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1785486221","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"3312350/608796938/607081df55ab0765a4915fac72b27b41c84fe0d7/1785484441/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"3312350/608796938/607081df55ab0765a4915fac72b27b41c84fe0d7/1785484441/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"3312350/608796938/607081df55ab0765a4915fac72b27b41c84fe0d7/1785484441/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"3312350/608796938/607081df55ab0765a4915fac72b27b41c84fe0d7/1785484441/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"3312350/608796938/607081df55ab0765a4915fac72b27b41c84fe0d7/1785484441/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257389006/2682fae2cd4516145e8fc058694d9be2773917b7/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257389006/2682fae2cd4516145e8fc058694d9be2773917b7/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1269545,"all_a